    "The side facing window of the development (drawing:04) hereby approved shall be glazed with obscure glass and fixed shut to a height of 1.7 metres above the finished floor level of the room in which the window is installed in a manner that they cannot be opened and retained thereafter.\r\rReason: To safeguard the current level of privacy enjoyed by the occupants of adjoining properties in accordance with and to ensure compliance with the Sutton Local Plan 2018.",
